<p>
Rest-frame absolute magnitudes. These are only calculated for galaxies with Count_Dust&gt;250 in the ParticleCounts table.
</p>

<p>
Note that columns with the _e suffix are calculated assuming an edge-on orientation
and columns with the _f suffix assume a face-on orientation. The remaining columns use
random orientations. For IR and submm bands only a single orientation is included
because emission in these bands is essentially isotropic.
</p>

